{"id":"00202","root":"uni00202_1","name":{"ja":"リリム","en":"Lilim"},"title":{"ja":"【お気楽夢魔】","en":"【Carefree Succubus】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【お気楽夢魔】 リリム","en":"【Carefree Succubus】 Lilim"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-06-13","limited":false,"characterId":7,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の下級夢魔。人間界に現れ、お腹が空けば人間の夢に侵入して生気を奪い、お金が欲しくなれば楽して儲けようと悪だくみに走る、欲望に忠実な典型的魔族気質。その日その日を好き放題に過ごして、過去は振り返らないお気楽さで世を渡っている。思慮が浅く自分勝手な性格のせいで疎まれることも多いが、それが性別や種族・陣営などによる垣根を作らず、積極的に誰とでも仲良くする理由にもなっている。特にヤタガラスの化身を名乗る魔族ミナサキとはいたずら仲間としてよくつるんでいるし、対魔忍のふうまとも友好的（？）な関係を築いている。気分転換に、いつもリボンで結っている髪をおろしてみた。こうすると、なぜだかとても懐かしい気分になるらしい。","en":"Lilim is a low-rank succubus from the Demon Realm. When she appears in the Human Realm, she invades humans' dreams to drain their life force if she's hungry, and if she wants money she'll scheme to make easy profit, embodying the typical demon temperament that loyally follows desire. She spends each day as she pleases, never looking back, and her carefree attitude lets her glide through life without regard for the past. Because of her shallow thinking and selfish nature, she's often shunned, yet that same lack of barriers based on gender, race, or faction also makes her eager to befriend anyone. She especially hangs out as a prank-partner with the demon Minasaki, who claims to be the incarnation of Yatagarasu, and she's built a friendly (perhaps?) relationship with the Taimanin Fuuma. For a change of pace, she once let her ribbon-tied hair down, which somehow made her feel oddly nostalgic."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"青葉りんご","forms":[{"id":"uni00202_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1236,2472],"sp":[130,130],"atk":[160,320],"def":[138,276],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","220004"]},{"id":"uni00202_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1872,3744],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[245,490],"def":[201,402],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","220004","220005"]},{"id":"uni00202_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2508,5018],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[330,663],"def":[264,526],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","220004","220005","220006"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},"220004":{"slot":"skill1","id":220004,"name":{"ja":"リリキッス"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 540% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"Self: take 30% of max HP as damage","tag":"instant"}]},"220005":{"slot":"skill2","id":220005,"name":{"ja":"スイートブレス"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のDEFを小ダウン、中確率で眠り状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":245,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のDEFを小ダウン、中確率で眠り状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":240,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のDEFを小ダウン、中確率で眠り状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":235,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のDEFを小ダウン、中確率で眠り状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のDEFを小ダウン、中確率で眠り状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"},{"text":"All enemies: 40% chance to inflict Sleep for 3 turns","icon":"sleep","tag":"ailment","ref":"ab:1"}]},"220006":{"slot":"ultimate","id":220006,"name":{"ja":"チャーム・ドリームハート"},"hits":1,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":350,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、ATKとSPDを中ダウンする"}},{"level":2,"sp":350,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力